  "html": "<section id=\"cw-layout-magazine\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: rgb(39, 33, 62); background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(244, 205, 98) 0px, rgb(244, 205, 98) 8px, rgb(39, 33, 62) 8px, rgb(39, 33, 62) 16px); background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: 100% 8px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(243, 237, 255); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 0px 12px 12px; width: 100%; word-break: break-word;\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #f3edff; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; padding: 24px 16px; width: 100%\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(61, 49, 90); border: 3px solid rgb(244, 205, 98); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 22px 16px; width: 100%;\"><p style=\"background: transparent; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(243, 237, 255); display: block; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0px 0px 24px; max-width: 100%; padding: 0px; text-align: left; width: auto;\">开场第一段：比赛结束后，人们先看到了比分。阅读一篇文章，也需要先交代背景，让读者知道事情从哪里开始。</p></section><p style=\"color: #f3edff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\">开场第二段：比分接近，真正需要讨论的是关键时刻的判断。连续的正文应留在同一个阅读容器里，左右都应有清楚的留白。</p><p style=\"color: #f3edff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\">开场第三段：接下来再进入具体章节。段落数量改变时，不应丢失内容，不应贴边，也不应为每段重复一层巨大的卡片内边距。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><section style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 30px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"background: transparent; background-color: #3d315a; border: 2px solid #f4cd62; color: #f3edff; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2><p style=\"color: #f3edff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong style=\"font-weight: 700\">重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p><blockquote style=\"background-color: #3d315a; border: 2px dashed #f4cd62; color: #f3edff; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 24px 0; padding: 20px; text-align: left\"><p style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote><p style=\"color: #f3edff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p></section><section style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 30px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"background: transparent; background-color: #3d315a; border: 2px solid #f4cd62; color: #f3edff; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2><ul style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px\"><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 20px 0 20px; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color: #f4cd62; border: 1px solid #c9b9eb; color: #000000; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">检查项</th><th style=\"background-color: #f4cd62; border: 1px solid #c9b9eb; color: #000000; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9b9eb; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">标题</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9b9eb; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">第一眼能否找到主题</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9b9eb; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">正文</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9b9eb; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">是否能够连续阅读</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9b9eb; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">引用</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9b9eb; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">是否与作者叙述区分</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p></section><section style=\"background: transparent; border: 0; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 30px 0 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"background: transparent; background-color: #3d315a; border: 2px solid #f4cd62; color: #f3edff; display: block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; width: auto\">把风格落实到每一个细节</h2><p style=\"color: #f3edff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\">报纸用硬边栏线建立秩序，杂志用大留白放慢速度，信笺让段落像一次自然的交谈。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 24px 0; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/reading-still-life.jpg?ref=master&v=0537832c544b1da46e9132fbf0b360b50d94e840b6077ec13a6f57c5c0ab925c\" alt=\"自然光下的阅读与写作静物\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><p style=\"color: #f3edff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 0 0 18px\">一个完整的句子，不应该为了装饰被删掉。一张原有的表格，也不应该被换成没有事实来源的数字。</p><p style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #c9b9eb; color: #f3edff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.95; margin: 32px 0 0; padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left\">读完之后，留下一个清楚的观点，比留下许多重复的色块更有价值。</p></section></section></section>",
